# GMS's own shape and its own ten levels: a share of the pool on a clock of
# its own, ending at 4% of it every 4 seconds. It rode the swing until the
# Priest's Holy Fountain built a clock to hang it on -- which paid a Crusader
# swinging at 0.6s more than three times what GMS pays them.
#
# GMS climbs both halves in a staircase (ceil(L/4)+1 percent every 9 -
# floor(L/2) seconds) that base + per_level cannot walk. Straightened to a
# fifth of a percent and half a second a level, which lands on GMS's master
# exactly and starts a little over its first rung.
name: "Self Recovery"
description: "Regularly recovers some HP, even in combat."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CRUSADER skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
base {
  regen_pct: 0.022
  regen_interval_seconds: 8.5
}
per_level {
  regen_pct: 0.002
  regen_interval_seconds: -0.5
}
